Mode </tech-label> to OFF. <abb>MMEL</abb> item 34-10-06/07 is also applied. <duref product="MMEL" ref="00008552"/> or <duref product="MMEL" ref="00008554"/>.</para></command></action></procbody></condition><action layer="1" lid="N.00008929.0001001.015" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008929.0001001.006"><challenge><tech-label type="cb">ADIRU 3 (26VAC &amp; AOA)</tech-label></challenge><response>Pull</response></cr-action><comment code="00008929.0001001.011"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008929.0001001.026">The <tech-label type="cb">ADIRU 3 (26VAC
